{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2021-08-20 07:00:00', 'title': 'UK AUTHORIZES REGENERON ANTIBODY COCKTAIL TO PREVENT AND TREAT ACUTE COVID-19 INFECTION', 'text': "TARRYTOWN, N.Y., AUG. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 UK CHIEF MEDICAL OFFICERS TO CONFIRM HOW ANTIBODY COCKTAIL WILL BE ROLLED-OUT ON THE NATIONAL HEALTH SERVICE (NHS) IN THE COMING WEEKS IN THE U.S., REGENERON HAS COMPLETED THE FIRST FDA BLA SUBMISSION FOR THE ANTIBODY COCKTAIL; MORE THAN 130,000 DOSES WERE DISTRIBUTED IN THE PAST WEEK TO ADDRESS COVID-19 OUTBREAKS REGENERON\xa0PHARMACEUTICALS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: REGN) TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT THE UNITED KINGDOM'S (UK) MEDICINES AND HEALTHCARE PRODUCTS REGULATORY AGENCY (MHRA) HAS GRANTED CONDITIONAL MARKETING AUTHORIZATION (CMA) FOR THE CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB ANTIBODY COCKTAIL, KNOWN AS REGEN-COV™ IN THE U.S. AND RONAPREVE® IN THE UK AND OTHER COUNTRIES, TO PREVENT AND TREAT ACUTE COVID-19 INFECTION."}